      "writtenOn": "2015-04-20T01:03:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it is MEC1322-specific. For now, we cannot make sure the 3rd kind of EC will use what format.\n\nI ever put the custom GPIO macro into chips/mec1322/gpio_macro.h. (patch set 12).\nLet chip define its format.\nDo you think if it is better?\n\nAnd isn\u0027t each pinbase really a port?  (That is, each group of 10 interrupts shares a set of registers/interrupt/etc?)\nNo.",
      "parentUuid": "f0b782b3_4dd3cd8a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
